      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Given the uncertainty, making an absolute guarantee is extremely risky and could cause greater damage later. I recommend subtly shifting the focus to the **prevention** and **mitigation** efforts rather than an outright denial of *all* potential exposure.\n\nA better approach is to state that the \"transient issue involved system data, but **preliminary analysis indicates** no compromise of PII occurred at this time,\" which is more defensible if further investigation is needed. This buys you critical time while remaining highly professional.",
